# Immutable released app versions (DESIGN_WEB_OD_APP_PLAN.md §2).
# One directory name per line (e.g. "v1"). CI rejects any change to files under
# a listed version directory — production asset changes require a NEW version.
#
# RELEASE PROCEDURE for the Web OD App:
#   1. Complete docs/webapp-hardware-qualification.md (the mandatory smoke set
#      is blocking).
#   2. In the release PR: add the version here, create
#      httpdocs/app/current-version.txt containing the same value, and add the
#      "OD App" link back to the site footer in httpdocs/index.html.
#   3. deploy-ftp-curl.sh refuses to publish a version named by
#      current-version.txt that is not listed here, so the two cannot drift.
#
# Nothing is released yet: v1 is still under development and remains editable.
# While this file lists no version, deploy-ftp-curl.sh EXCLUDES httpdocs/app/
# from deployment entirely — unreleased must also mean unpublished, because
# httpdocs deploys wholesale.
